 const founder=`<section class="founder-story section"><div class="wrap founder-grid"><div class="founder-copy"><span class="eyebrow light">The man behind Shama</span><h2>Sardar Zahoor Iqbal</h2><p>Born into a family struggling for a better life in Pakistan, Sardar Zahoor Iqbal developed a passion for business at a young age and opened a grocery shop in his hometown of Fateh Jang.</p><p>In 1988 he began a new adventure in France. After building experience across France, the UK and Italy, he founded the food business in 2003 under the name of his elder daughter, Shama.</p><p>His focus on relationships, dependable service and quality products continues to shape the company today—from humble beginnings in a 250 m² warehouse to a growing European food business.</p></div><div class="founder-media"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/00ae33_6b312b11ad8f4578af43615631d040f8~mv2_d_1595_1600_s_2.jpg" alt="Sardar Zahoor Iqbal"><div class="award-glass"><strong>Pakistan Achievement Awards</strong><span>Excellence in community services in business · 2019</span></div></div></div></section>`;
