if(document.body.dataset.page==='about'){document.querySelector('#page-content').innerHTML=hero('Built on belief.','A story of courage, relationships and authentic flavour—growing from one vision in 2003.','About us')+`<section class="about-manifesto section"><div class="wrap manifesto-grid"><div class="manifesto-kicker"><span>SHAMA</span><i>since 2003</i></div><div class="manifesto-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Our beginning</span><h2>More than food.<br><em>A promise kept.</em></h2><p>Shama International was founded with a clear belief: ethnic foods would become an everyday part of the French market. What began with courage and a small warehouse grew through trust, consistency and a deep respect for traditional taste.</p><a class="text-link" href="catalogue.html">Discover our products <span>→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="journey-section section"><div class="wrap"><div class="journey-head"><span class="eyebrow light">The journey</span><h2>One vision.<br>Three decades of courage.</h2></div><div class="journey-line"><article><b>1988</b><span>A new beginning</span><p>Sardar Zahoor Iqbal starts a new chapter in France, building experience across France, the UK and Italy.</p></article><article><b>2003</b><span>Shama is born</span><p>The food business begins under the name of his elder daughter, Shama—rooted in family and ambition.</p></article><article><b>Today</b><span>Growing together</span><p>A trusted range of authentic products, long-standing relationships and a vision that keeps moving forward.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="founder-editorial section"><div class="wrap founder-editorial-grid"><div class="founder-portrait"><span class="portrait-word">FOUNDER</span><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/00ae33_6b312b11ad8f4578af43615631d040f8~mv2_d_1595_1600_s_2.jpg" alt="Sardar Zahoor Iqbal, founder of Shama International"><div class="portrait-award"><b>2019</b><span>Pakistan Achievement Award</span></div></div><div class="founder-editorial-copy"><span class="eyebrow">The man behind Shama</span><h2>Sardar<br>Zahoor Iqbal</h2><blockquote>“Business grows when relationships grow first.”</blockquote><p>Born into a family striving for a better life in Pakistan, he discovered his passion for business at a young age and opened a grocery shop in his hometown of Fateh Jang.</p><p>In 1988 he chose a new adventure in France. By 2003, he had transformed years of resilience and experience into Shama International. His commitment to suppliers, customers and co-workers remains the company’s foundation.</p><div class="founder-sign"><span>Founder & Chairman</span><b>Shama International</b></div></div></div></section><section class="beliefs section"><div class="wrap"><div class="beliefs-title"><span class="eyebrow">What stays constant</span><h2>Our beliefs move<br>the business forward.</h2></div><div class="belief-strips"><article><span>01</span><h3>Relationships</h3><p>Good business begins with respect—for suppliers, customers and every co-worker.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Quality</h3><p>We strive to offer the best products with service our customers can depend on.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Progress</h3><p>Listening to customers helps us introduce better products and grow with purpose.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="vision-final section"><div class="wrap vision-inner"><span class="eyebrow light">Vision & mission</span><h2>Traditional taste.<br><em>Worldwide ambition.</em></h2><p>We believe in extending our variety by understanding what customers truly need—bringing the strength of Shama to more tables, every day.</p><a class="btn btn-cream" href="contact.html">Build with us <span>↗</span></a></div></section>`}
